,"",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她犹豫着展开了信，那些规整的字母和语重心长的教导瞬间有了声音，在她耳边念叨起来。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"18":{"step":[[18,19,""]],"type":1,"name":["男人的声音","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"615320.png","audio":"7208647","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“是时候端正一下你在教会学校的行为了，不要吓唬老师，说她肩膀上坐着鬼魂，也不要提醒同学厕所里究竟存在着什么。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"19":{"step":[[19,20,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"314219.png","audio":"613501980","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["但有时候我不是在吓唬他们。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"20":{"step":[[20,21,""]],"type":1,"name":["女人的声音","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"637620.png","audio":"7208761","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“要学会拒绝那些专门让你夜间上门除灵的委托，那对你的健康没有任何好处。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"21":{"step":[[21,22,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"314219.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["大部分人都说自己白天没空，哪怕夜晚会被吓个半死，也坚持让我晚上去。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"22":{"step":[[22,23,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"314215.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["毕竟，你们也说过，赚钱更重要。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"23":{"step":[[23,24,""]],"type":1,"name":["男人的声音","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"615320.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“你现在长大了，有自己的想法，可你真的要一辈子过这种孤单的生活吗？”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"24":{"step":[[24,25,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"314222.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["孤单……但我并不讨厌。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"25":{"step":[[25,26,""]],"type":1,"name":["男人的声音","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"615320.png","audio":"7208581","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“因为你不赞成除灵是项伟大的工作，其他人自然会低看你。你将没有朋友、舒适的房子和便捷的生活，多么凄惨啊！”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"26":{"step":[[26,27,""]],"type":1,"name":["女人的声音","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"637620.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“最可怕的是，亲爱的，你将始终被误解为骗子。但爸爸妈妈知道，你的诚实甚至会让你在面对鬼魂时宁可保持沉默，也不愿意说出伤人的话。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"27":{"step":[[27,28,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"314217.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["倒不是诚实的问题，我只是没办法和它们对话，和你们说过很多次了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,29,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"314215.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["而且，除灵也不需要听见鬼魂说话，它靠的是真本事。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"29":{"step":[[29,30,""]],"type":1,"name":["女人的声音","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"637620.png","audio":"7208735","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“亲爱的，天赋即命运，爸爸妈妈无法觉醒的‘灵视’在你身上奇迹般地出现了。你要珍惜这份恩赐，做出一番大事业。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"314219.png","audio":"613502022","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["命运……人总归有一死，要说什么是既定的命运，那就是死亡了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,93,""]],"type":1,"name":["女人的声音","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"637620.png","audio":"7208699","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“我知道你肯定又会说什么‘人总归有一死’，你才15岁，不能如此消极！”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"32":{"step":[[32,33,""]],"